      "message": "At a limiting distance of {limiting_distance_used_m} m (less than 1.2 m), Table 9.10.14.4.-A permits no unprotected openings (0%), and the design shows {opening_area_m2} m². Openings there need closures under Sentence 9.10.14.4.(2). This departs from the acceptable solution in Sentence 9.10.14.4.(1)."
